---
title: "withdrawInvestedCapitalIfCanceled (Shared across sale types)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_canceled: check isCanceled == true
    q_check_canceled --> q_revert_not_canceled: sale not canceled
    q_revert_not_canceled --> [*]: revert SaleNotCanceled
    q_check_canceled --> q_check_withdrawn: sale is canceled
    q_check_withdrawn --> q_calc: position.investedCapital > 0
    q_check_withdrawn --> q_revert_none: no capital to withdraw
    q_revert_none --> [*]: revert NoCapitalToWithdraw
    q_calc --> q_update: withdrawAmount = position.investedCapital
    q_update --> q_transfer: position.investedCapital = 0
    q_transfer --> [*]: transfer(investor, withdrawAmount), emit CanceledCapitalWithdrawn

    note right of q_calc
        INV-001: only callable when isCanceled == true
        INV-002: investor receives full investedCapital back
        INV-003: position.investedCapital zeroed to prevent double withdrawal
    end note
